  "rationale": "The notes capture a large amount of technical detail and correctly identify most of the launch risks and decisions. However, they suffer from significant contradictions and hallucinations. The overview incorrectly states that Viktor was assigned the migration runbook due October 28, while later sections assign it to Maya due September 28. The notes also report the superseded 10% rollout stage as both a final decision and an action item, directly contradicting the final 5% decision listed immediately after. Several important action items are missing, including Dana escalating the ledger dependency with Grace Obi, Rohan chasing Joelle Park for legal review, and Rohan emailing the beta customers. The notes are also highly repetitive, listing the same points multiple times across the summary, decisions, and action items sections."
